#: src/onboarding.glade:63
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Sozlash tugallandi!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:82
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Biz tugatdik! Ubuntu Hello hozir ushbu kompyuterda faol. Autentifikats"
"iya qilish uchun odatda parolingizni kiritishingiz kerak bo'lgan hamma"
" narsani bajarishga harakat qiling, masalan, sudo bilan buyruqni bajar"
"ish. Agar siz kalitlarni avtomatik ochish funksiyasini yoqsangiz, logi"
"n kaliti yoki KWallet ham tizimga kirganingizda avtomatik tarzda ochil"
"adi.\n\nKeyinchalik kengaytirilgan sozlamalarni oʻzgartirish yoki qoʻs"
"himcha modellar qoʻshish uchun Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratorni ochishingiz"
" mumkin. Ushbu oynani yopish va Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratorni ochish uch"
"un quyidagi Finish tugmasini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.glade:130
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tizimga kirganingizdan soʻng parol soʻrovlarini oldini ol"
"gan holda, yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida login kalitingizni avtomat"
"ik ravishda yoki KWallet qulfini ochishi mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.glade:142
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Avtomatik kalitlash/KWallet qulfdan chiqarishni yoqing"

#: src/onboarding.glade:184
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Parolni tasdiqlang"

#: src/onboarding.glade:216
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Aniqlik siyosatini o'rnatish"

#: src/onboarding.glade:235
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Burchaklar, masofa va boshqa omillarning o'zgarishi tufayli yuz moslig"
"i hech qachon saqlangan yuz modeli bilan bir xil bo'lmaydi. Ushbu sahi"
"fada siz Ubuntu Hello qanchalik qat'iy bo'lishini belgilashingiz mumki"
"n."

#: src/onboarding.glade:274
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Tez"

#: src/onboarding.glade:290
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Ko'proq noaniq o'yinlarga ruxsat beradi, \nlekin skanerlash jarayonini"
" sezilarli darajada tezlashtiradi."

#: src/onboarding.glade:329
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Balanslangan"

#: src/onboarding.glade:345
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Hali ham nisbatan tez aniqlash, \nlekin uzoqroqda tizimga kirmasliging"
"iz mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.glade:384
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Xavfsiz"

#: src/onboarding.glade:400
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Biroz xavfsizroq variant, \nlekin sizni autentifikatsiya qilish uchun "
"ko'proq vaqt ketadi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:443
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Yuz modelini qo'shish"

#: src/onboarding.glade:462
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Sizni tasdiqlash uchun Ubuntu Hello sizni tanishi uchun yuzingiz model"
"ini saqlashi kerak. Yuzni skanerlashni boshlash uchun quyidagi Scan tu"
"gmasini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.glade:564 src/onboarding.glade:655
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Veb-kamera sozlanmoqda"

#: src/onboarding.glade:581
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Infraqizil emitent miltillayaptimi?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:599
msgid "yes"
msgstr "ha"

#: src/onboarding.glade:616
msgid "no"
msgstr "yo'q"

#: src/onboarding.glade:674
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tizimingizda mavjud kameralarni avtomatik ravishda qidira"
"di, shuning uchun veb-kamerangiz ulanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling. A"
"niqlangandan so'ng foydalanish mumkin bo'lgan veb-kameralar ro'yxati k"
"o'rsatiladi. Foydalanmoqchi bo'lgan birini tanlang va \"Keyingi\" tugm"
"asini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.glade:697
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Veb-kameralaringiz tekshirilmoqda, kuting..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:749
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar fayllari yuklab olinmoqda"

#: src/onboarding.glade:768
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello sizni tanib olishi uchun oldindan oʻrgatilgan uchta yuzni"
" tanish maʼlumotlar toʻplami kerak, ular hozir yuklab olinadi. Quyida "
"yuklab olish jarayonini ko'rishingiz mumkin."

#: src/onboarding.glade:789
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Yuklash boshlanmoqda..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:838
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello ga xush kelibsiz!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:854
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versiya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:875
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu sehrgar sizni sozlash jarayoni bo'ylab ko'rsatib beradi va siz u"
"chun avtomatik ravishda Ubuntu Hello sozlaydi. Davom etish uchun keyin"
"gi tugmasini bosing."

#: src/onboarding.glade:899
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Bekor qilish"

#: src/onboarding.glade:919
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Keyingisi"

